# Upstream YOLO checkpoints: Ultralytics downloads these on demand, and they
# were tracked in three separate locations. The trained ear labeler
# (model_weights/yolov11_ear_detector.pt) stays tracked -- it is not
# reproducible without a GPU run.
yolo11n.pt
yolo11m.pt
yolo26n.pt
weights/

# Ultralytics YOLO tooling: AGPL-3.0, which this Apache-2.0 repository cannot
# redistribute. Kept on disk so the auto-labelling workflow still runs locally,
# but not part of the published repo. Nothing in the BlazeEar model, its
# training, its evaluation or the browser demo needs these -- they were used to
# propose labels while building data/splits/*.csv, which are checked in.
finetune_yolov11.py
utils/yolo11_demo.py
model_weights/yolov11_ear_detector.pt
model_weights/yolo11x-pose.pt
